WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:03.290
Rice blast is a fungal disease of rice.

2
00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:08.040
In Yunnan, China, farmers changed the
way they planted their rice fields.

3
00:00:08.090 --> 00:00:13.370
On the susceptible varieties, blast
became 94 per cent less severe.

4
00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:16.610
And their yield rose by 89 per cent.

5
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:22.090
So why can a whole field of crop plants
be wiped out by a single new disease?

6
00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:25.180
In this mission, you'll see
how a changing environment,

7
00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:29.550
a new disease, climate or
chemical, tests a population.

8
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.900
Then you'll find out exactly
what those farmers changed,

9
00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:34.900
and why it worked so well.

10
00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:40.670
Your mission: explain why one new disease
can wipe out a whole field of crop plants.
